    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5fc6b4361ec32a7ee953",
      "document_start": 912,
      "document_end": 944,
      "text": "（b）测量系统，测量被测对象的位移、速度或加速度等振动响应信号；",
      "section_id": "section_fe9ddb4d2040"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4c8f0804927bf1b92d93",
      "document_start": 944,
      "document_end": 987,
      "text": "（c）分析系统，将激励和响应信号采集到计算机中，用模态参数识别方法识别系统的模态参数。",
      "section_id": "section_fe9ddb4d2040"
